 "description": "AgentStack MCP = Work Graph control plane. After session + context.project_id: agents.work_next (mcp_work_loop_v1) -> plan_claim -> plan_execute (CAS/leases). Follow packet.next_action; catalog/discovery.search only if no packet. One-shot CRM/upload may call domain actions directly. Spine: agents.plan_get -> agents.work_next -> agents.plan_claim -> agents.plan_execute. Context.project_id on every batch. Detail: prompts/get agentstack_session_setup and agentstack_execute_budget.",
 "icons": [
  {
   "mimeType": "image/png",
   "src": "https://agentstack.tech/mcp/icon"
  }
 ],
